{"id":990,"date":"2023-09-27T21:17:29","date_gmt":"2023-09-28T04:17:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/?page_id=990"},"modified":"2023-09-28T22:00:16","modified_gmt":"2023-09-29T05:00:16","slug":"game-elements","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/features\/game-elements\/","title":{"rendered":"Game Elements"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-990\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-990-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-990-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h1>Exploring the Game Elements Feature<\/h1>\n<p>In the world of game development, organization and clarity are the cornerstones of success. Whether you're a solo indie developer or part of a large game development team, keeping track of all the intricate details that go into creating a video game is a daunting task. This is where the <strong>Game Elements<\/strong> feature in <strong>Gamescrye<\/strong> comes into play. It's a powerful structure that helps you manage, document, and categorize every aspect of your game, from characters and quests to assets and game mechanics.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-990-1\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-990-1\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-1-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-990-1-0\" ><div id=\"panel-990-1-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2>What are Game Elements?<\/h2>\n<p>This is where the Game Elements feature in Gamescrye comes into play. It's a powerful structure that helps you manage, document, and categorize every aspect of your game, from characters and quests to assets and game mechanics.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-990-1-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-990-1-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"2\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-990-1-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-990\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/game-element-example-e1695788908832.png\" width=\"941\" height=\"566\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/game-element-example-e1695788908832.png 941w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/game-element-example-e1695788908832-300x180.png 300w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/game-element-example-e1695788908832-768x462.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 941px) 100vw, 941px\" title=\"game-element-example\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-990-2\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-990-2\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-2-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-990-2-0\" ><div id=\"panel-990-2-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"3\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3>Files<\/h3>\n<p>One of the key functionalities of the Game Elements feature is the ability to store files. Game development involves a multitude of assets, including concept art, spreadsheets, sound files, 3D models, and more. With this feature, you can upload and associate these files directly with the relevant Game Elements. This means that when you're working on a character design, for instance, you can easily access all the associated files, making collaboration and reference a breeze.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-990-2-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-990-2-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"4\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-990-2-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-990\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/file-storage.png\" width=\"674\" height=\"265\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/file-storage.png 674w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/file-storage-300x118.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 674px) 100vw, 674px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-990-3\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-990-3\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-3-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-990-3-0\" ><div id=\"panel-990-3-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"5\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3>Content Editor<\/h3>\n<p>In addition to storing files, the Game Elements feature allows you to add rich word content. This feature is invaluable for documenting various aspects of your game. You can include backstories for characters, detailed descriptions of quests, specifications for character design, level design, game mechanics, anything you need. This makes it an ideal hub for comprehensive game design documentation.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-990-3-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-990-3-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"6\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-990-3-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-990\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/toolbar.png\" width=\"595\" height=\"66\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/toolbar.png 595w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/toolbar-300x33.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 595px) 100vw, 595px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-990-4\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-990-4\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-4-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-990-4-0\" ><div id=\"panel-990-4-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"7\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h3>Categorize Elements<\/h3>\n<p>A robust taxonomy system is essential for any game development project. Taxonomy involves categorizing each element to create a relationship between groups of elements. With this feature, you can create custom categories tailored to your game's specific needs. For instance, you can create categories like \"UI,\" \"Quest,\" \"NPC,\" \"Story Dialog,\" or any other relevant classification that helps you organize your game elements efficiently.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-990-4-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-990-4-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"8\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-widget-style panel-widget-style-for-990-4-1-0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-990\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/category-selector.png\" width=\"829\" height=\"473\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/category-selector.png 829w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/category-selector-300x171.png 300w, https:\/\/gamescrye.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/09\/category-selector-768x438.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 829px) 100vw, 829px\" alt=\"\" \t\tclass=\"so-widget-image\"\/>\n\t<\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pg-990-5\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\" ><div class=\"siteorigin-panels-stretch panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-990-5\" data-stretch-type=\"full-stretched\" ><div id=\"pgc-990-5-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div class=\"panel-cell-style panel-cell-style-for-990-5-0\" ><div id=\"panel-990-5-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_siteorigin-panels-builder panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"9\" ><div id=\"pl-w6513bba8027ae\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-w6513bba8027ae-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-no-style\" ><div id=\"pgc-w6513bba8027ae-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-w6513bba8027ae-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-headline panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\